  "description": "ZEWHOA crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n m a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C16 H32 Ce3 Mn2 O26,Na1 1+,11(H2 O1),H1 O1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Ce1G (Ce) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.211-3.764 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.62-109.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [MnIV2CeIV3O6Na(OAc)8(H2O)5](OH)·10H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(IV), Ce(IV).",
